CadTech Timber Heel / Chord / Web Physical Joint Fix
=====================================================
Analytical truss panel points remain unchanged.
Rendered/exported timber is face-trimmed at physical joints:
- web -> top/bottom chord face
- bottom chord -> sloping top-chord face at heel
- top-chord peak -> one chord butts to the opposing chord face
